{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using weighted fusion instead of concatenation, maintaining identical RNA/image encoders and aggregation settings. Validation accuracy of 0.5232 and F1 of 0.5084 slightly lag behind the previous concat-based baseline (0.5266 accuracy, 0.5104 F1), suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance in this configuration. The effectiveness of weighted fusion and the RNA/image encoder combination remains uncertain without further comparative benchmarks."
}

